rior5 Munlyte ZenefDialogue: 0,0:00:17.75,0:00:19.75,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,TranslationDialogue: 1,0:00:17.75,0:00:19.75,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,TranslationDialogue: 0,0:00:17.75,0:00:19.75,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,DemonRin FUNimationDialogue: 1,0:00:17.75,0:00:19.75,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,DemonRin FUNimationDialogue: 0,0:00:19.75,0:00:22.71,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,RawsDialogue: 1,0:00:19.75,0:00:22.71,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,RawsDialogue: 0,0:00:19.75,0:00:22.71,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Neo-RawsDialogue: 1,0:00:19.75,0:00:22.71,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Neo-RawsDialogue: 0,0:00:12.90,0:00:14.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Miras kalan irade...Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.63,0:00:17.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Akıp giden yıllar... İnsanların hayalleri...Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:20.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bunlar durdurulamaz.Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:23.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,İnsanlar özgürlüğü arzuladıkça...Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:26.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...bunlar ebediyen var olmaya devam edecek!